Package: cerebro
Type: Package
Title: AI Agent Toolchain for R
Version: 0.2.0.1
Authors@R: c(
    person("Troy", "Hernandez", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "troy@cornball.ai",
           comment = c(ORCID = "0009-0005-4248-604X")),
    person("cornball.ai", role = "cph"))
Description: Meta-package that installs the cerebro AI agent toolchain:
    'saber' (AST code analysis), 'pensar' (knowledge graph), 'corteza'
    (agent runtime), and 'llm.api' (Large Language Model connectivity).
    Optional integration with 'hacer' supports plain-text ToDo planning.
